              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nyakati 9:15–16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahala hazina yosi ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi Mlungu na ya nyumba ya mfalume. Wahala chila chitu piya ngao zosi za zahabu zotengezwa ni mfalume Selemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye mfalume Rehoboamu achitengeza ngao za shaba badalaye na achizipha akulu a arindzi ariorinda mryango wa nyumba ya mfalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila mfalume ariphoinjira nyumbani mwa Mwenyezi Mlungu, arindzi a ryango azihala, na badaye aziuyiza chumba cha arindzi a ryango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        }
